{"sections":[{"slug":"Dirichlet特征","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Dirichlet特征"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">特征</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Dirichlet 特征”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $q$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">特征是群同态</span> $\\chi\\colon (\\mathbb{Z}/q)^\\times\\to\\mathbb{C}^\\times$.</p>\n<p>Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">特征是连续群同态</span> $\\chi\\colon \\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}}^\\times \\to \\mathbb{C}^\\times$.</p>\n<h2>L-<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span></h2>\n<p>Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">特征</span> $\\chi$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/L-函数","text":"L-<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\nL(\\chi,s) = \\sum_{n\\geq 1}\\chi(n)n^{-s}=\\prod_p\\frac{1}{1-\\chi(p)p^{-s}}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">本原特征</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">导子</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若正整数</span> $\\tilde q, q$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $\\tilde q \\mid q$, <span lang=\"zh\">则模</span> $\\tilde q$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">特征给出模</span> $q$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">特征</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">由此产生了本原特征的概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即不能由更小的模数给出的模</span> $q$ <span lang=\"zh\">特征</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">此时</span> $q$ <span lang=\"zh\">称为该特征的导子</span> (conductor).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">连续群同态</span> $\\chi\\colon \\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}}^\\times \\to \\mathbb{C}^\\times$ <span lang=\"zh\">的导子</span> $q_\\chi$ <span lang=\"zh\">是最小的使得</span> $\\chi$ <span lang=\"zh\">穿过</span> $(\\mathbb{Z}/q_\\chi)^\\times$ <span lang=\"zh\">的正整数</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}